  "scope": "Existing completed proofs ported; no added mathematical premises or admissions. Original source remains unchanged.",
  "changes": [
    "Add module headers, public imports/sections and exposed definition bodies; make referenced helper declarations public.",
    "Import all of Mathlib.Basic.Real.Basic to use underlying real instances in retained proof terms; use backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false during elaboration. ROOT12 also imports all of the normed real instance module.",
    "Normalize Function.comp_def, Pi pointwise operations, real rpow notation and explicitly selected weights.",
    "Use Finset.prod_le_prod\u2080 with the existing nonnegativity premises, and adapt integral/asymptotic simplification.",
    "Derive strict positivity from the retained natural sum lower bound by omega; remove tactics after goals have already closed."
  ],
  "reviewable_patch": "stage8/evidence/compatibility-port.patch"
